      "summary": "Context decay poses a significant risk to feature deployment as it leads to the gradual loss of critical organizational knowledge. This decay can result in unnecessary delays, revisiting settled decisions, and ultimately, a slower release cycle. Addressing this issue requires not just better documentation but also a focus on shortening the feedback loop between development and real user interaction.",
